      "content": "those are okay starts, but they're a bit generic. i want to really lean into the \"grittiness\" of the different districts. like, the city shouldn't feel uniform. can you give me more specific archetypes for the different ethnic neighborhoods? i want to make sure the characters actually feel like they belong in their specific parts of town—you know, like when you walk into a certain area, the types of people and the specific kind of street crime you see just change. can you flesh out a few more characters for the more \"troubled\" or high-crime immigrant neighborhoods vs the more established parts of town?",
